<p>SARWAR NE KAHA APNA GHAR BAAR LUTAA DUNGA.</p>

<p>ISLAM TERI QAATIR..**2.</p>

<p>QOO'N APNA BAHAA DUNGA.</p>

<p>
1. MAAREGA AGAR ZALIM, NAAWAK TERI GARDAN PAR.</p>

<p>JHOOLE SE UTHAKAR MAIN..***2</p>

<p>ASGHAR ASWS. KA GALAA DUNGA.</p>

<p>
2. BAAZU PE TERE AAYI, GAR KOI MUSEEBAT BHI.</p>

<p>WALLAAH BACHALUNGA...**2.</p>

<p>BAAZU E WAFA DOONGA.</p>

<p>
3. PYASA NA RAHEGA TU AY DEEN MERE REHTE.</p>

<p>PAANI KE EWAZ APNA..*2.</p>

<p>MAIN QOON PILAA DOONGA.</p>

<p>
4. HOGI JO ZARURAT TO AKBAR ASWS. KA BHI SEENA MAI.</p>

<p>BARCHI KE LIYE TERE..**2.</p>

<p>AAGE MAI BADHAA DOONGA.</p>

<p>
5. BE PARDA AGAR HOGA DARBAR MEIN ZALIM KE.</p>

<p>PARDE KE LIYE TUJHKO...**2.</p>

<p>ZAINAB ASWS. KI RIDA DOONGA.</p>

<p>
6. TUJHPE HO AGAR QATRA BAAZAR MEIN KUFE KE.</p>

<p>QUR'AAAN KATE SAR SE ...**2.</p>

<p>DUNIYA KO SUNAA DOONGA.</p>

<p>
7. ABID NE KAHA BABA DARBAR MEIN ZALIM KE.</p>

<p>QUTBO'N SE TERA MAQSAD...**2.</p>

<p>JO HAI WO BATAA DOONGA.</p>

